WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:05.630
<b>When you wake up,
stay here and wait.</b>

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:53.540
<b>Episode 12 
Woven Miracles</b>

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:03.470
<i>In the beginning, I thought she was just a child.</i>

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.930
<i>No, back then, she actually was.</i>

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.690
<i>She was a simple child, bright and honest,</i>

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:14.900
<i>who grew up bathed in normal 
happiness like it was natural.</i>

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:20.970
<i>Thinking back, what a cruel thing 
I did to a child like that.</i>

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:25.610
<i>Making her fight, get hurt, 
struggle with decisions...</i>

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:30.490
<i>But still, Illya always looked 
straight ahead in the end.</i>

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:35.300
<i>She plunged into an uncertain future</i>

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.900
<i>with no thought for her chance of success.</i>

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:42.760
<i>It's a sentiment we adults have forgotten.</i>

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:47.220
<i>That commonplace selfishness 
of an average little girl.</i>

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.230
I'll save both Miyu and the world!

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.400
<i>Ah, I see.</i>

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.320
<i>If there is any justice in this world 
that must be protected...</i>

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:08.330
<i>Excalibur!</i>

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.810
<i>It would surely be the wish of a little girl,</i>

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.440
<i>sincerely pursuing the future.</i>

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:27.430
All right, now we can...

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.450
It's futile.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.390
Even with the most powerful holy sword,

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:34.310
you can't eliminate the Heroic Spirits 
rising infinitely from the muck.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:47.280
Erica...

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.280
Yes.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:49.780
Will it open,

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.460
or not?

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.210
I'm sorry.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:57.640
I'm trying to open it, but...

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.450
But it won't open!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.160
I see.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:07.460
Well, I'll leave some advice 
for you, you poor thing.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:09.790
In order to realize your wish,

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.720
you need two Holy Grails.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.260
So it's true.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.880
I think this means we're out of options.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.530
This is bad.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.950
As long as that exists, enemies will 
keep rising up indefinitely!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.810
Rocks?

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:38.080
They're trying to crush us with the mass!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.300
Then, once more!

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.000
Illya!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.720
I'm out... of magic?

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.300
That Noble Phantasm consumes 
too much magical energy!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.210
Please run!

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:55.670
I won't run.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.770
Illya-san?

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.230
The future always

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.240
lies ahead!

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.200
What...

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.200
...is that?

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.220
I-It's a

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:31.680
sword?

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.810
What is that?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.220
No.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.770
That's...

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.930
That's bad!

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.480
Erica?

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:47.360
Illya! Pick up that sword!

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.910
I don't know what it is,

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.750
but it has the power to blast away that muck!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:01.850
Hot...

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.630
I'll hold it!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.940
If we want to break through this, 
now's our only chance!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.970
Fly! And aim for

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:14.730
the source of this muck!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.190
No! Stay away!

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:28.210
Stop.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.240
Cast that sword aside, Illyasviel!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:52.730
Stop!

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:58.480
Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop!

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.870
Wh-What in the world?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.220
We did it.

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.000
The muck is clearing up!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.850
Julian, this is my...

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.580
no, our victory!

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.210
Illya...

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.610
That is the rule of this world.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:49.280
An arrow of flame to convict counterfeits,

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.490
to convict us.

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.860
Erica-chan?

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.180
I see.

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:59.080
So it finally discovered us.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.880
Wh-What?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.380
Beatrice, I'll permit up to two thunderbolts.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:18.270
I love you, Julian-sama.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.390
<i>Summon Thunder!</i>

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.460
Stop this already, Julian!

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.520
What good does more fighting do?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:31.360
Let's work together to save 
both Miyu and the world!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:37.410
On the off-chance that it's possible 
to save both the world and Miyu...

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.280
That's all you'll be able to save.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.740
What do you mean?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.660
Blast them away,

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.000
past their

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.720
very atoms!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:05.980
Mjölnir!

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:10.770
Julian, listen to us—

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.400
Look out!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.850
Not yet... Run!

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.020
Emiya-kun?

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.630
Julian...

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:35.760
Emiya-kun!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:38.970
Onii-chan!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.180
Rin-san, Onii-chan's...

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.890
He won't hold out long.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.970
No...

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.270
Why? Isn't there anything we can do?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.950
I thought you could heal 
him with thaumaturgy!

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.320
I've done everything I can!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:57.480
But trying to repair what's damaged 
while keeping his blood flowing

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.160
is too inefficient!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:03.820
My rate of healing can't keep up 
with his body's deterioration!

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:09.340
I'm desperately short on the magical 
energy needed to heal him...

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.920
You're joking, right?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.910
Onii-chan...

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.270
We finally managed to reunite,

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.920
and we're parting again?

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.440
That's cruel...

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.980
That can't be,

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.200
Onii-chan!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:31.900
Huh?

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.400
That's...

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.480
Immediately after I arrived in this world,

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.510
I found this in the great cavern.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.460
This gem

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.030
belongs to you, yes?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:54.330
I'll show you a miracle of 
gemstone thaumaturgy.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.650
Onii-chan!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.630
Thank you, Miyu.

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:41.800
For now, we've all made it safely out alive.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.790
Thank goodness...

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.430
Truly, thank goodness.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.930
No!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.230
Stay away!

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:00.570
What a horrific, yet funny, sight.

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.360
A h-hand?!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.900
The sword became a hand?

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.410
Huh?!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.680
We thought it was a sword, but it's a hand?

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.270
One that moves on its own, too.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.640
Well, it's quite attached to her.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:17.630
It seems harmless, doesn't it?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.900
Is that the problem here?

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:25.040
Onii-chan, your injuries still haven't...

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.580
No, I'm all right now.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:31.440
It's just that it's chilly in this outfit.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:33.180
And you're barefoot, yourself.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.070
Thank you for rescuing us, everyone.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.780
So, how about it?

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:43.200
If you don't have anywhere else to go, 
want to come to my place?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.080
Your home?

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.950
Would that also be Miyu's home, perhaps?

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.210
I'm in! I want to! I want to!

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.710
M-Me, too!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.480
I don't see why not.

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:58.380
We need to relocate our base, anyway.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:00.840
We have no objections, either.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.090
Nope!

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:06.750
Are you okay with that too, Angelica?

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:08.850
Yes.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.490
Are you sure, Illya-san?

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.140
About picking up that troublesome one?

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.100
Well, I couldn't just leave her alone.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.320
I am a discarded doll.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.280
I have no will of my own.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.070
Please do with me as you will.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.650
Understood.

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.410
Then, for now, follow us.

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.340
Kuro?

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.050
It's nothing.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.240
Let's go.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:51.470
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:54.370
<i>Only Gil-kun had disappeared.</i>

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.040
<i>He said retrieving his Card was his objective,</i>

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.810
<i>so we knew this would happen.</i>

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.600
<i>But I thought he'd say something 
before leaving, at least.</i>

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:10.740
Th-This is Onii... Shirou-san and Miyu's home?!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.420
It's quite the mansion!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:16.710
This is far too different from 
the Emiya household...

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.200
...that we know!

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.130
We just have a single-family home.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.780
What's with this difference?

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:24.660
So Miyu's actually a rich girl, huh?

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:33.290
Welcome home, Miyu.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.710
I'm home, Onii-chan.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.080
What?

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.610
Nothing!

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:47.790
You'll need to get changed,

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.870
but first, a bath is in order.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:53.650
Cypress baths are wonderful!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.490
They're the spirit of the Japanese!

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.980
Hey, make some room.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:05.710
Honestly, why do you think this version 
of the Emiya home is so different?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.550
Emiya home... Emiya Shirou...

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.210
Emiya Miyu.

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.020
That's what it would mean.

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:18.230
In a way, we aren't related 
to Miyu, but we sort of are.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.110
It feels like fate, doesn't it?

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:24.390
M-Maybe Miyu's father is...

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.190
Who knows?

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.460
Well, we'll get them to tell us.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:32.660
Who they are, what happened, and...

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.740
Why the sudden weird shriek?

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.540
B-Because you touched me in a weird spot!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.900
Huh? I didn't do anything like that—

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.000
I-I-Is something there?!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.530
In our bath?!

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.670
Hey, quit flailing around! You—

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:51.930
Got it!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:59.030
Th-Th-That's it!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.410
What's with this hand?!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.430
Wait, Illya.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.150
Huh?

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.330
It's trying to write something.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.670
Nakata?

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.840
Na-ka-ta-na-ka...

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:16.990
Tanaka!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.510
You're mean!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.950
Did you forget about me?!

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.260
You wrote a note telling me to stay and wait,

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.560
so I waited at the school this whole time!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.180
W-We didn't forget about you.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:45.510
Meanie, meanie, meanie! Meanie!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:47.020
Th-That's right. That's why we're 
here to pick you up, you know?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.480
More importantly, Tanaka-san, your hand...

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.580
Tanaka's restored!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.880
That easily?!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.750
Tanaka-san, what in the world are you?

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.620
Oh?

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.060
What are you two doing outside?

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.330
And you two just took a bath.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.880
Well, we had to pick up...

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.110
A bath?

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.170
I'm taking a bath, too!

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:13.510
Who is this girl?

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.390
I'm not sure how to explain...

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:18.680
Let's just deal with that later.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.260
It's cold outside...

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:25.230
We shouldn't have gone outside 
right after our bath.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.130
What else could we do?

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:30.530
We couldn't leave Tanaka-san by herself.

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:31.850
I guess not.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.070
Still...

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:36.110
What's with that outfit, Kuro?

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.820
And what's with your choice?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:43.050
Seriously, wearing a onesie 
at eleven years old!

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:44.290
I couldn't help it.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:48.500
It's what Onii— Shirou-san lent me!

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:52.390
But whose clothes are these?

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.990
Onii-chan, lay something else out.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:18:01.330
But these bear pajamas are 
your favorite, aren't they?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:04.430
They are, but I want something different today.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.390
<i>They're Miyu's?!</i>

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.290
Well, when I think about it, 
that makes sense, but...

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:12.300
Huh? Huh? Miyu's into these?

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:15.860
In our world, Luvia chooses all 
her outfits, so we never knew!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:18.080
Then, how about this?

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.820
Yeah, that works.

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:25.700
She looks good in it.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.960
Yeah. Miyu's beautiful in Japanese outfits.

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:31.740
Onii-chan, do my hair?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.590
You can do that yourself.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:36.550
Just do it anyway.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.890
Yes, yes, my princess.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.670
<i>You know...</i>

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.720
<i>Miyu's acting spoiled!</i>

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.590
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:47.830
<i>I think I'm about to turn all weird again!</i>

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.400
<i>Little sister mode Miyu?</i>

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.810
<i>I can't believe she had that up her sleeve!</i>

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:57.010
It's been a long time since I 
messed with your hair like this.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:57.860
Yeah.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.470
Shall I try for something 
a bit more complicated?

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:03.570
No, something simple is fine.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:05.780
We have a lot of guests, though.

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:08.580
Don't you want to dress up 
a bit for the occasion?

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.220
You just want to do that yourself, right?

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:12.990
You saw through me.

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:15.710
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:16.790
Hmm?

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.590
I made a friend.

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:25.350
I see. What's she like?

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:30.200
She's cheerful, energetic, and incredibly kind.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:36.790
She called me her friend, 
and she fought at my side.

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:42.030
I know she was scared, 
but she came to rescue me.

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:47.810
I believe it's thanks to Illya 
that I can be here now.

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:48.990
Miyu...

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:52.510
Miyu was the one who rescued me.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.730
Thanks to her, I learned that

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:02.020
abandoning your friends and running 
away won't resolve anything.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:07.110
That you'll never find anything precious 
if you're always looking down.

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:08.130
Yeah.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.860
There, that should do it.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:17.480
Jeez, you did my hair like this 
when I'm going to bed soon?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:20.130
No, it's still too early for bed.

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:23.240
There's a lot we need to talk to everyone about.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.140
Isn't that right,

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:26.450
you two?

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:28.220
Oh?

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:29.160
Huh?

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.870
H-How long were you...

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.210
Uh...

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.800
Since the bear pajamas?

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.590
Miyu's mad!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.010
I feel like I've seen lots of rare sides to Miyu!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:49.720
Oh. That's right, Miyu.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:51.890
Here, you dropped this.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.060
Don't lose it again, okay?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.920
Yeah.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.570
Thank you.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:08.120
Well, it may not suit your 
bear pajamas very well...

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:13.730
<i>I see.</i>

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:16.080
<i>So my wish was granted.</i>

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:20.150
<i>"May she find friends she can smile with."</i>

00:22:55.330 --> 00:22:57.940
Illyasviel... Miyu.

00:22:58.450 --> 00:23:00.900
Enjoy your brief dream while you can.

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:05.110
Your wish and mine can never coexist.

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:08.820
Do not forget that. I will be sure

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:10.910
to use both of you.

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:19.720
I'm sure there's a lot we'd all like to ask.

00:23:20.140 --> 00:23:23.290
This will be a long discussion.

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:29.050
So first, I'd like to tell you our story.

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:31.630
The story of what happened

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:33.290
to Miyu and me.
